; the widest sum here needs 1054 operands, and a budget below that leaves the
; BVPLUS nested, which is the difference between answering in two seconds and
; not answering at all.  Checked in that form after the conversion -- with the
; budget put back to the 1000 of #891 this file still fails to return inside
